    "content": "Before approving a commercial lease, the institution MUST verify that the registered title holder is the contracting entity.\nIF the competent land-use record excludes commercial occupancy, the institution MUST obtain a written variance before approving a commercial lease.\nA current building-condition inspection is PREFERRED before lease commencement, but it is not a condition of lease approval.\nThe institution should make appropriate arrangements for continuity."
